q BT 65.20 771.39 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.867 Tw (She served him coffee for ten years. Same booth. Same order. Black coffee, no sugar. Vincent) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 750.98 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Castellano never looked at her twice, and that was exactly how Elena Ruiz wanted it.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 721.50 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.086 Tw (The diner sat on a corner in Brooklyn, the kind of place with cracked vinyl seats and a neon sign) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 701.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.955 Tw (that buzzed at night. Elena worked the five a.m. shift, and by six, booth six was always) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 680.68 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.823 Tw (occupied. The men in booth six never ordered food. They ordered coffee and silence, and they) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 660.27 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (talked as if the waitress pouring it was furniture.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 630.79 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Elena was not furniture. She was a notebook.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 601.31 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.201 Tw (It started the winter her husband died. Marco Ruiz had been the Castellano family's bookkeeper,) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 580.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.998 Tw (a quiet man with careful hands who came home smelling of ledger ink and fear. One night he) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 560.49 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.261 Tw (did not come home at all. The police called it a robbery. Elena buried him on a Tuesday, and on) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 540.09 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Wednesday she went back to work, because the rent did not care that she was a widow.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 510.60 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.628 Tw (She knew it was not a robbery. Marco had told her, three nights before he died, that he had) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 490.20 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.752 Tw (found something in the books. Money that moved and never came back. A second set of) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 469.79 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.020 Tw (numbers, hidden inside the first. He said the words *insurance policy* and then he stopped) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 449.38 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (talking about it, the way men do when they have said too much.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 419.90 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Elena did what grief told her to do. She listened.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 390.42 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.331 Tw (Booth six was an education. The men spoke in the lazy shorthand of people who believe no one) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 370.01 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 2.247 Tw (is listening. Dates. Amounts. Names of warehouses, judges, union officials. Elena carried a) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 349.60 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.426 Tw (small order pad, and between the coffee orders she wrote it all down in a shorthand of her own.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 329.19 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Booth six thought she was writing down eggs and toast. She was writing down an empire.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 299.71 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.685 Tw (For ten years she kept the notebooks in a shoebox under her bed. Forty-one notebooks, one for) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 279.30 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.566 Tw (every season of listening. She never told a soul. She raised her son, Danny, on tips and silence,) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 258.89 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.598 Tw (and she told herself the notebooks were only insurance, the way Marco had said. She would) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 238.48 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (never need them. She only needed them to exist.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 209.00 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (Then Danny turned nineteen and discovered poker.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 179.52 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.631 Tw (It started small, the way it always does. A game in a basement. A loan from a man with a kind) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 159.11 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.644 Tw (smile and a calculator for a heart. By the time Elena found out, Danny owed forty thousand) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 138.70 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.408 Tw (dollars to a crew that collected debts for the Castellano family, and the man with the kind smile) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 118.29 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg (had given him one week.) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 88.81 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 1.108 Tw (Elena did not cry. She had not cried in ten years. She went to work the next morning, poured) Tj ET Q
q BT 65.20 68.40 Td 0.0784 0.0784 0.0784 rg 0.808 Tw (coffee in booth six, and listened to Vincent Castellano laugh about a judge he had just bought.) Tj ET Q
